prompt defect. Per this task's hard constraints (no post-validation
rewrite/re-prompt loop; reject-only architecture mandatory; no permissive
prose parsing), this residual non-determinism cannot be fully eliminated
by a prompt/schema-only fix — a user hitting this endpoint may still need
to manually retry an occasional rejected detection call. The originally-
